# Nexus Enterprise Starter

> Enterprise-grade Backend Starter Kit built with Domain-Driven Design (DDD), Clean Architecture, CQRS, Domain Events, OpenTelemetry, and TypeScript.

---

## Vision

Nexus Enterprise Starter is a production-ready backend foundation designed for long-term maintainability, scalability, and architectural excellence.

The goal of this project is to provide a reusable foundation for building enterprise-grade applications without sacrificing code quality, domain integrity, or developer experience.

---

## Architecture Principles

- Domain-Driven Design (DDD)
- Clean Architecture
- Modular Monolith
- CQRS Ready
- Event-Driven Ready
- Dependency Injection
- Strategic & Tactical DDD Patterns
- Architecture Enforcement
- Observability First
- Cloud-Native Mindset

---

## Technology Stack

| Category | Technology |
|-----------|------------|
| Runtime | Node.js |
| Language | TypeScript |
| HTTP Framework | Fastify |
| Dependency Injection | Awilix |
| Validation | Zod |
| Database | MongoDB Native Driver |
| Logging | Pino |
| Testing | Vitest |
| Observability | OpenTelemetry |

---

## Project Structure

```text
src/
├── bootstrap/
├── config/
├── infrastructure/
├── kernel/
├── modules/
└── shared/
```